'''Great Grass Plains''' was a large area of plains located 40 kilometers from [[Theed]] on the [[planet]] [[Naboo]].<ref name="AbEverything">''[[Star Wars: Absolutely Everything You Need to Know]]''</ref> During the [[Battle of Naboo]], the [[Gungan Grand Army]] fought against the [[Trade Federation]] [[battle droid]]s on the Great Grass Plains.<ref name="TPM" />

==Behind the scenes==
The scene on Great Grass Plains was shot near Livermore, California. To get rid of the earthlike feeling, the hills were digitally stretched.<ref name="Scenes">''[[Star Wars in 100 Scenes]]''</ref>

